# Dress Down ("Creatures lose all abilities.", layer 6) is on the battlefield before Infinite Guideline Station enters, on turn 9. Three Alpine Grizzlies (4/2, turns 1, 3 and 5) station it
# for 12 in the same turn: it becomes an artifact creature, and "12+ | Flying" is one static ability whose effect began in layer 4, so its layer 6 and 7b parts keep applying although
# Dress Down, earlier in layer 6, took the now-creature's abilities - a 7/15 with flying (CR 613.6, 721.2b). Only the station ability and the abilities it prints were Dress Down's to
# take. Its enters trigger (it was no creature then) made one Robot, the Station itself being the only multicolored permanent.

